        "content_type": "formula",
        "formula": "$$\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{\\text{Opposite}^2}{\\text{Hypotenuse}^2} + \\frac{\\text{Adjacent}^2}{\\text{Hypotenuse}^2} = \\frac{\\text{Opposite}^2 + \\text{Adjacent}^2}{\\text{Hypotenuse}^2}$$"
